    <fieldset>
        <legend>Project description </legend>
        <div>
            This library helps you easily to present result of games in your site.Currently
            Fanex.Result.Core has supported HTML table , Excel file and json-data and it also
            presents data in four languages( english, chinese , traditional chinese and korean).
            <br />
            <br />
        </div>
