    <fieldset>
        <legend>How to use? </legend>
        <div>
            <ul>
                <li>Dowload:
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="DownLoad/Fanex.Result_rev1_4.zip">Core & dll dependecy: </a></li>
                        <li><a href="DownLoad/Fanex.Result_CssTpl_rev1.4.zip">Css Template</a> </li>
                        <li><a href="DownLoad/Fanex.Result_ExcelTPl_rev1.4.zip">Excel Template</a> </li>
                    </ul>
                </li>
                <li>Installing:<br />
                    <b>Set up:</b>
                    <p>
                        * You only need to add reference Fanex.Result.Core to your project and put related
                        dll into bin folder.
                    </p>
                    <div>
                        * Required DLL:
                        <ul>
                            <li>Fanex.Result.Core </li>
                            <li>Fanex.Common.dll - (removed from version 1.4.1)</li>
                            <li>RemotingRef.dll</li>
                            <li>IBCFile.dll (be used in remotingRef.dll)</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        * Put these files into your project if you want to:
                        <br />
                        <ul>
                            <li>Export Excel file:
                                <ul>
                                    <li>NPOI.dll</li>
                                    <li>Fanex.Npoil.Extension.dll (removed from version 1.4.2)</li>
                                    <li>Put excel template in App_Data folder
                                        <br />
                                        <img src="DownLoad/templateGuide.png" alt="structure" />
                                    </li>
                                </ul>
                            </li>
                            <li>html string:
                                <ul>
                                    <li>System.Web.Razor.dll (2.0) </li>
                                    <li>RazorEngine.dll (3.2.0.0)</li>
                                    <li>Place css template into your project.
                                        <br />
                                        <img src="DownLoad/css_guide.png" alt="structure" />
                                    </li>
                                </ul>
                            </li>
                            <li>Json String
                                <ul>
                                    <li>Newtonsoft.Json </li>
                                </ul>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li>Examples:
                    <div style="font-size: large;">
                        Render sportbook game:
                        <ul>
                            <li>
                                <br />
                                Transfer from your datatable to Fanex.Result.Core.DTO object.<a href="Download/ResultService.cs.txt">Download
                                    example code</a>
                                <br />
                                <img src="DownLoad/dataaccess.png" alt="structure" />
                            </li>
                            <li>Initilize result setting:
                                <br />
                                <br />
                                <img src="DownLoad/setting.png" alt="structure" />
                            </li>
                            <li>Export HTML:<a href="Download/ReportController.ResultPage.cs.txt">Download example
                                code</a>
                                <pre>var htmlResult= ResultEngine.HtmlParser(dataSb, setting);</pre>
                            </li>
                            <li>Export Excel:
                                <pre>var _excelStream = ResultEngine.ExcelParser(dataSb, setting);</pre>
                            </li>
                            <li>Export json:<pre> var jsonResult = ResultEngine.JsonParser(dataSb,setting);</pre>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <b>Get full example on LRF project:
                            <br />
                            GIT:git@gitlab.nexcel.vn:licensee/lrf.git </b>
                        <br />
                        How to find result page code in LRF project:
                        <ul>
                            <li>1. Controller: LRF-Main\Fanex.Athena\Web\Fanex.Athena.Controllers\Report\ReportController.ResultPage.cs</li>
                            <li>2. Views:LRF-Main\Fanex.Athena\Web\Fanex.Athena\Views\Report\Result </li>
                            <li>3. Data service: Transfer data from datatable to Fanex.Result.Core.DTO objects.
                                <br />
                                LRF-Main\Fanex.Athena\Business\Fanex.Athena.Service\Implement\Report\ResultService.cs
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
